      Dual Sump Pump Check Valve Plumbing: Primary &amp; Battery Backup
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-6">
      When adding an auxiliary 12V battery backup pump to your basement sump pit, how you plumb the two discharge lines determines whether your home stays dry or floods during a power failure. Connecting two pumps into a shared discharge line without independent check valves creates an <strong>infinite recirculation loop</strong> where water pumps in circles inside the pit. Here is the master plumber piping protocol.
    </p>

    <!-- Key Metrics Grid -->
